Tseeb-los-cuav thaum-tuaj: ['xor:'] ua: { :b <- ((tus-kheej thiab: b rov-qab) lossis: (tus-kheej rov-qab thiab: b)).
}.

Tawm sau-ntawv: ['Length is:'] + ['ABCD'] qhov-ntev.
>> x := ['ABCDE'].

Tawm sau-ntawv: ['Length is:'] + x qhov-ntev.
((['ABC'] qhov-ntev + 1 = 4) thiab: (2 ≠ 3)) rov-qab rov-qab tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['Yes']. }.
(((3 > 4) lossis: (4 > 2)) thiab: (Tseeb lossis: Cuav), thiab: (Tseeb xor: Tseeb) rov-qab ) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['Yes']. }.
{ Tawm sau-ntawv: ['Running']. } pib.
